      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the draft. the sentiment score came back a bit lower than we'd like—it was okay, but we really need it to hit a higher threshold to get past the internal review. \n\ncould you try another version? maybe lean into the \"hope/revival\" aspect a bit more to boost that positivity score, but please remember what i said about not making it sound fake or like a melodrama. it still needs to feel like a real professional organization reaching out, not a script for a soap opera. just try to get that score up a notch while keeping it believable.",
